1.Print the numbers from 1 to 50 which are divisible by 5 using looping statement and display the output


public class Looping {

	public static void main(String[] args) {
		
		for(int i=0;i<50;  i++) {
			if(i % 5  ==0)
			System.out.print(i+" ");
	       }
		}
	}
	

